stos – e nunca utilizados!<br><br>Prepara-te para abrir um novo buraco negro na galáxia!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600130/extras/76ab52885914fd6058e4a84f3b0a8c49.poster.avif?t=1738686818\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600130/extras/76ab52885914fd6058e4a84f3b0a8c49.webm?t=1738686818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/600130/extras/76ab52885914fd6058e4a84f3b0a8c49.mp4?t=1738686818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
